 "title": "Bundestag writings",
 "hook": "Political scientists Corinna Kroeber and Tobias Remschel have compiled a dataset of “all written communication published by the German Bundestag between 1949 and 2017,” unifying datasets released by Germany’s parliament “in a manner easily accessible to researchers applying text analysis.” For each of the 131,835 reports, requests, bills, and other documents, the dataset provides the full text, date, author information, and more.",
